   "gap_before": 3.4,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "home_office.dlg9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then do the report first thing, before ten, while your head is fresh. That's your deep work block.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.85,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_office.dlg9",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And the emails?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.83,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "home_office.dlg9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Clear them in two short bursts, maybe right after lunch and after the last call. Don't keep the inbox open while you write.",
   "est_sec": 7.23,
   "gap_before": 1.01,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "home_office.dlg9",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That's hard for me,",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
